# ── Vendored runtime binaries ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ripgrep (single binary) and Git for Windows (a full tree providing git + bash
# + the POSIX toolchain) are fetched at build time by scripts/vendor-sync.mjs
# from pinned, checksummed upstreams — NOT committed. They're large and fully
# reproducible, and scripts/tauri-wrapper.mjs runs vendor-sync before every
# build/dev so packaged apps still ship them offline. The manifest + README stay
# tracked as the source of truth (pinned versions, checksums, layout).
/vendor/*
!/vendor/manifest.json
!/vendor/README.md
